This package provides Python interfaces to the ShardLoom native engine. A package
may include a native CLI executable and an optional in-process Python extension.
These binaries incorporate dependencies with their own license and notice terms.

THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/manifest.json identifies each locked registry dependency,
local vendored patch, and its original license/notice files. The corresponding complete texts are included
under THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/texts. This conservative inventory includes build, test,
and platform-specific packages; it is not a claim that every listed component is
linked into every binary. ShardLoom's Apache-2.0 license does not replace these
dependencies' license terms.
